{
    "title": "Driving Dodge Charger Race Car",
    "description": "Muscle car - shaping force on city streets and isolated tracks Dodge Charger: Play right now! Charger immerses you in the genuine racing scene, complete with cops, street drifting, and parking obstacles. Missions in this simulator using US vehicles are really fascinating and entertaining. This game simulator will provide you with the most realistic racing experience you have ever had. You may experience incredible race circuits, dramatic twists, street drifting, and parking in your automobile.\r\nIn American Muscle Car Simulator, you must demonstrate your expert driving abilities in new drift scenarios. High speed will allow you to drive even quicker in traffic and save you time! You may dramatically upgrade your muscle vehicle with the incentives you earn!\r\n \r\nIN THE SIMULATOR YOU WILL FIND:\r\nRealistic car physics\r\nTricky challenges and missions\r\nTrue car models\r\nFree driving mode\r\nDaily rewards and benefits\r\n \r\nNOW PLAY REAL TIME MULTIPLAYER! DRIFT and RACE against real opponents online!\r\n\r\nDOWNLOAD THE RACING APP\r\nA genuine next-generation driving experience. Do you enjoy racing, drifting, or simply ripping up the asphalt? Tune your automobile and do anything! This game is just too wonderful to be available for free!\r\n \r\nREAL PHYSICS\r\nThe most realistic physics engine available on mobile will provide you with unparalleled control on the road and beneath the hood.\r\n \r\nLIVE YOUR DREAM\r\nYou may fulfill your desire of becoming a professional driver by acquiring, tweaking, and personalizing your ideal automobile. Join the millions of other gearheads who have embraced the ultimate driving challenge!\r\n \r\nA LIVING CITY\r\nDon't become bored! You may do side quests on this massive map and drive your automobile forever! Find and finish all of the assignments on this map that awaits your exploration! While you wait for your mode line, you can freely drive your automobile. You don't even have to stop having a good time!\r\n \r\nOUTSTANDING GRAPHICS\r\nFeel as though you're walking along the street in real life with these lifelike images. Enjoy the high-quality images that include natural light. Allow yourself to be immersed in this realm!\r\n \r\nEXPERIENCE LIMITLESS DRIVING\r\nBy using actual mechanics, you are able to drive your own automobile anyway you wish. You may participate in a drift race or an engine power race! In this never-ending driving experience, you can do anything you want in real life!\r\n \r\nIf you enjoy driving actual muscle cars, you will like our Driving Dodge Charger Race Car. This game will allow you to become an adept driver in modern city traffic with cops. Cannot imagine your life without car games? Then you should definitely try City Drive car simulator. Look for new cars of 2022 and learn how to drive a transport vehicle in car game.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Muscle car - shaping force on city streets and isolated tracks Dodge Charger: Play right now! Charger immerses you in the genuine racing scene, complete with cops, street drifting, and parking obstacles. Missions in this simulator using US vehicles are really fascinating and entertaining. This game simulator will provide you with the most realistic racing experience you have ever had. You may experience incredible race circuits, dramatic twists, street drifting, and parking in your automobile.<br>In American Muscle Car Simulator, you must demonstrate your expert driving abilities in new drift scenarios. High speed will allow you to drive even quicker in traffic and save you time! You may dramatically upgrade your muscle vehicle with the incentives you earn!<br> <br>IN THE SIMULATOR YOU WILL FIND:<br>Realistic car physics<br>Tricky challenges and missions<br>True car models<br>Free driving mode<br>Daily rewards and benefits<br> <br>NOW PLAY REAL TIME MULTIPLAYER! DRIFT and RACE against real opponents online!<br><br>DOWNLOAD THE RACING APP<br>A genuine next-generation driving experience. Do you enjoy racing, drifting, or simply ripping up the asphalt? Tune your automobile and do anything! This game is just too wonderful to be available for free!<br> <br>REAL PHYSICS<br>The most realistic physics engine available on mobile will provide you with unparalleled control on the road and beneath the hood.<br> <br>LIVE YOUR DREAM<br>You may fulfill your desire of becoming a professional driver by acquiring, tweaking, and personalizing your ideal automobile. Join the millions of other gearheads who have embraced the ultimate driving challenge!<br> <br>A LIVING CITY<br>Don&#39;t become bored! You may do side quests on this massive map and drive your automobile forever! Find and finish all of the assignments on this map that awaits your exploration! While you wait for your mode line, you can freely drive your automobile. You don&#39;t even have to stop having a good time!<br> <br>OUTSTANDING GRAPHICS<br>Feel as though you&#39;re walking along the street in real life with these lifelike images. Enjoy the high-quality images that include natural light. Allow yourself to be immersed in this realm!<br> <br>EXPERIENCE LIMITLESS DRIVING<br>By using actual mechanics, you are able to drive your own automobile anyway you wish. You may participate in a drift race or an engine power race! In this never-ending driving experience, you can do anything you want in real life!<br> <br>If you enjoy driving actual muscle cars, you will like our Driving Dodge Charger Race Car. This game will allow you to become an adept driver in modern city traffic with cops. Cannot imagine your life without car games? Then you should definitely try City Drive car simulator. Look for new cars of 2022 and learn how to drive a transport vehicle in car game.",
